        "case_id": "issue-05",
        "summary": "A user must not be able to retrieve full details of a ticket that belongs to a different user.",
        "invariants": [
          "When an authenticated user requests a ticket by its identifier, the system must only return the ticket's details if the ticket is owned by that user.",
